sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant API as api_server
  participant ORC as Orchestrator
  participant RSK as Risk
  participant ADP as T4 Adapter
  participant T4 as Plus500 T4
  participant AUD as Audit
  UI->>API: POST /orders (T4OrderRequest)
  API->>ORC: propose(intent, trace_id)
  ORC->>RSK: validate(intent, account_snapshot)
  RSK-->>ORC: {approved:true, size, max_loss}
  ORC->>ADP: place_order(intent)
  ADP->>T4: Protobuf OrderNew
  T4-->>ADP: OrderAck
  ADP-->>UI: WS frame t4.order.ack
  T4-->>ADP: Fill
  ADP-->>UI: WS frame t4.order.fill
  ORC->>AUD: log(action=fill, hash_chain)
  AUD->>UI: SSE audit.append
